    "excerpt": "Special thanks to Brenda, Tony, Kathie, Theresa and Jennifer for all their help and valuable assistance in putting this information together in a cohesive form and for helping to keep our organization a true God company.  There are so many great healers and scientists that I couldn’t possibly mention them all.  I send ...",
    "fullText": "One World Press Special thanks to Brenda, Tony, Kathie, Theresa and Jennifer for all their help and valuable assistance in putting this information together in a cohesive form and for helping to keep our organization a true God company.  There are so many great healers and scientists that I couldn’t possibly mention them all.  I send my humblest apologies to those whom I did not mention.  A great healer or scientist is not swayed by humanity’s conditioning or monetary systems.  Rather, he or she forges ahead seeking truth so all can benefit.  Introduction W elcome to a fantastic journey into vitality.  Health is one of our greatest assets, and many refer to the body as a temple, or a vehicle that carries around the true Self while we’re on this planet.  However, we often treat our cars better than we treat our bodies."
