    "excerpt": "STRUCTURES — The pituitary gland, pineal gland, thyroid and parathyroid glands, thymus, adrenal glands, pancreas (including the islets of Langerhans), glands within the intestinal mucosa, ovaries and testes. FUNCTIONS—The regulation of all the activities of the body from breathing, nerve response, and temperature chang...",
    "fullText": "Glandular System (Endocrine) STRUCTURES — The pituitary gland, pineal gland, thyroid and parathyroid glands, thymus, adrenal glands, pancreas (including the islets of Langerhans), glands within the intestinal mucosa, ovaries and testes. FUNCTIONS—The regulation of all the activities of the body from breathing, nerve response, and temperature changes, to elimination. This is all accomplished through hormones, neurotransmitters, steroids, and the like. The glandular system is tied into our emotional and mental bodies as well."
