    "fullText": "The Immune System Your immune system is the police force of your body. It offers protection from invaders (parasites) and toxins. Without your immune system, you would not be able to live on this planet. (Remember the “boy in the bubble” who had no immune system?) Two Types of Immune Systems You have two types of immune systems at work. They are the extracellular immune system and the intracellular immune system."
