    "excerpt": "We do know that in the embryo stages the spinal cord and the gut tissues are the first manifestation from the head area.  As the embryo cell opens up, this gut tissue now becomes the source of most of our organs and glands.  This gut tissue in the fetus later becomes the GI tract, thus creating a dynamic relationship b...",
    "fullText": "Pituitary Gland We do know that in the embryo stages the spinal cord and the gut tissues are the first manifestation from the head area.  As the embryo cell opens up, this gut tissue now becomes the source of most of our organs and glands.  This gut tissue in the fetus later becomes the GI tract, thus creating a dynamic relationship between the GI tract and the rest of the body.  Because of this, it is vital that you clean and strengthen the GI tract in your detoxification program, that is, if you wish to have true success at regenerating your glands, as well as your whole body."
