    "excerpt": "Since the thyroid/parathyroid affects the body’s ability to utilize calcium, we find that bone problems, depressive disorders and connective tissue weaknesses can be eliminated by regenerating the thyroid/parathyroid glands.  Hyperthyroidism is easy to overcome through detoxification.  Never allow any doctor to destroy...",
    "fullText": "Thyroid And Parathyroid Glands Since the thyroid/parathyroid affects the body’s ability to utilize calcium, we find that bone problems, depressive disorders and connective tissue weaknesses can be eliminated by regenerating the thyroid/parathyroid glands.  Hyperthyroidism is easy to overcome through detoxification.  Never allow any doctor to destroy or remove the thyroid gland because of hyperactivity The thyroid/parathyroid gland is vital to your well-being in a multitude of ways that greatly affect your quality of life."
