    "excerpt": "Acidosis stimulates osteoclasts and the formation of calcium deposits.  Calcium is ionized (hardened) in the presence of acids (anionic).  The regulation of ionic calcium in the body’s fluid is essential to the proper growth and repair of bones.  This, as previously stated, is greatly influenced by diet, lifestyle, hor...",
    "fullText": "Bone Growth And Repair Acidosis stimulates osteoclasts and the formation of calcium deposits.  Calcium is ionized (hardened) in the presence of acids (anionic).  The regulation of ionic calcium in the body’s fluid is essential to the proper growth and repair of bones.  This, as previously stated, is greatly influenced by diet, lifestyle, hormones and steroids.  Bones, as any tissues, organs and glands of your body, are composed of cells.  All cells in your body require an energy source (nutrition) and a way to eliminate (lymphatic system, kidneys, skin, lungs and bowels).  Make all the cells in your body healthy.  Detoxify (clean), alkalize and regenerate.  Every cell in your body will thank you.  First understand Nature, then copy it.  — V."
