    "excerpt": "However, this process can happen with free radicals, like oxalates, which can then form calcium oxalate stones.  This type of anionic reaction causes inflammation and tissue damage.  It is very important to understand the meaning of acid and alkaline and their effect upon tissue, as this will give you an overview of di...",
