    "excerpt": "Eating this way keeps the body’s pH factors acidic.  The acid by-products after metabolism also add to this already over-acid condition, causing inflammation (fire), which is a killer of cells.  As stated earlier, the body, in its infinite wisdom, tries to compensate for this by several methods, including: steroid prod...",
    "fullText": "Module 5.3 Eating this way keeps the body’s pH factors acidic.  The acid by-products after metabolism also add to this already over-acid condition, causing inflammation (fire), which is a killer of cells.  As stated earlier, the body, in its infinite wisdom, tries to compensate for this by several methods, including: steroid production, cholesterol (lipid) plaquing, calcium extraction, and electrolyte or fluid retention.  This attempt by the body to alkalize itself is only self-preservation.  Check for acidity Buy some litmus papers, also known as pH-testing papers, and keep checking your saliva and urine, approximately one to two hours after you eat.  This will help you to see what is causing your over-acid condition.  Alkalization is key to tissue regeneration, to the breaking up of stones, and to the removal of plaqued lipids.  Lipid plaquing from inflammation/acidosis causes poor circulation leading to tissue death, heart attack and strokes."
