    "fullText": "Mild Cleansing Effects Cold and flu-like symptoms Low-grade fevers (99°–100° Fahrenheit) Coughing with or without discharge Clear and yellow mucus discharge from nose or throat (lungs, bronchi, etc.; this mucus may include blood) Minor aches and pains Mucus in stools Mucus in urine Loss of energy (may go up and down) Rashes and itching Disease symptoms increasing temporarily Mucus from eyes Mild headaches Minor blurred vision Minor vertigo Weight loss (average 8-15 lbs. in two weeks. Depends upon level of thyroid weakness. Can be as little as 2 lbs.) Chills Emotions rising up, such as mild crying, anger or even laughter Short term nose bleeds Some rectal bleeding (hemorrhoids or lesions) Minor blood in urine"
