    "excerpt": "However, I never recommend them unless your colon is “locked” and you can’t have a bowel movement.  The continual use of coffee enemas has a whiplash effect causing extreme enervation of the colon and inflammation of the liver and kidneys.  Coffee enemas also have a negative effect upon the nervous system creating hype...",
    "fullText": "Four Ways To Cleanse The Bowels However, I never recommend them unless your colon is “locked” and you can’t have a bowel movement.  The continual use of coffee enemas has a whiplash effect causing extreme enervation of the colon and inflammation of the liver and kidneys.  Coffee enemas also have a negative effect upon the nervous system creating hyper- or hypoactivity of this system.  This then will have a residual effect upon the whole body in numerous ways including nerve disorders, severe constipation, diarrhea, bloating, edema, and acidosis."
