    "excerpt": "Meditation will open doors that were previously shut, and will allow true healing to take place.  Your knowingness of, and relationship with, God will expand greatly.  By opening yourself in the above manner, spirit can flow through you unobstructed.  This can bring great healing, and if you’re “listening,” you never k...",
    "fullText": "Habit #2 Meditation: Relax! Relax! Relax! Meditation will open doors that were previously shut, and will allow true healing to take place.  Your knowingness of, and relationship with, God will expand greatly.  By opening yourself in the above manner, spirit can flow through you unobstructed.  This can bring great healing, and if you’re “listening,” you never know what you might experience.  It is far better to listen to God than to speak to God.  Remember, just be."
