    "excerpt": "Tissue mineral analysis can play a vital role in understanding some of your body’s symptoms.  Most naturopaths and many other healthcare practitioners use hair (tissue) analysis as part of their practice.  These analyses include dietary recommendations, but the diets suggested are not based upon natural health principl...",
    "fullText": "Appendix E Tissue mineral analysis can play a vital role in understanding some of your body’s symptoms.  Most naturopaths and many other healthcare practitioners use hair (tissue) analysis as part of their practice.  These analyses include dietary recommendations, but the diets suggested are not based upon natural health principles.  Conclusion Blood, hair, saliva and urine analysis should be correlated with an iris analysis, and clinical (body) observation, as well as with the body’s symptoms.  It is easy to be misled with only a partial understanding of systemic conditions when using body fluids alone as diagnostic tools.  Detoxification can also drastically change blood, hair, saliva, and urine analysis and to the untrained physician or health care practitioner, it can fool them into thinking the body is in trouble when it is only cleaning itself."
