    "excerpt": "” Robert Morse is a member of The International Association of Naprapathic Physicians and the American Naturopathic Medical Association.  He is an Honorary Member of (ASPEMT) Associacao Profissional dos Especialistas da Medicina Tradicional (Portugal).  In 1998 he was given an Honorary Degree from the Medical Associati...",
    "fullText": "To Receive A Full Catalog, Or To Order: 800-381-2700 ” Robert Morse is a member of The International Association of Naprapathic Physicians and the American Naturopathic Medical Association.  He is an Honorary Member of (ASPEMT) Associacao Profissional dos Especialistas da Medicina Tradicional (Portugal).  In 1998 he was given an Honorary Degree from the Medical Association of Portugal for his professional work in Tissue Regeneration.  Twenty-five years ago, Dr.  Morse created extra strong, tissue specific, botanical formulas for his rejuvenation clinic.  These formulas have received worldwide acclaim and are used by physicians, clinics, and individuals throughout the world.  A frequent lecturer and talk-show guest, Dr.  Morse is the author of the books The Illusion Called Disease, and Getting Healthy with Herbal Formulas, and numerous articles in the field of natural health.  He lives in Port Charlotte, Florida.  His website is www. godsherbs. com, and he can be contacted at info@godsherbs."
