    "excerpt": "No one ever goes it alone. I thank every courageous spirit who has sought out this information and acted upon it. Thank you. You deserve the highest praise. A special thank you goes out to all the www.sunfood.com staff for your support, vision, determination and hard work. John McCabe, your editing and ideas have made ...",
    "fullText": "A C K N O W L E D G E M E N T S No one ever goes it alone. I thank every courageous spirit who has sought out this information and acted upon it. Thank you. You deserve the highest praise. A special thank you goes out to all the www.sunfood.com staff for your support, vision, determination and hard work. John McCabe, your editing and ideas have made this book sparkle. Angela Hartman and Susan Wildes, you have motivated me to bring this infor- mation to millions of people in a format all can understand, use and apply. Javier Michalski, you appeared at the right moment, in the right way, with a fantastic plan."
