    "excerpt": "99% of all food on Earth is raw plant food.  In the grand scheme of things, cooked food is nonexistent, and animal food for omnivores and carnivores is minimal as the plant-eaters (mostly insects) are by far the dominant creatures on Earth.  Eating raw plant food provides you with an unlimited variety of food choices. ...",
    "fullText": "T H E S U N F O O D D I F T 99% of all food on Earth is raw plant food.  In the grand scheme of things, cooked food is nonexistent, and animal food for omnivores and carnivores is minimal as the plant-eaters (mostly insects) are by far the dominant creatures on Earth.  Eating raw plant food provides you with an unlimited variety of food choices.  There are so many raw plant foods on this planet that you could taste some- thing new every single day for the rest of your life and still not even come remotely close to trying 1% of what is here on Earth!  For instance, there are over 500 varieties of avocados.  And there are at least 80 varieties of persim- mons!  There are even over 300 varieties of durian!  T H E S U N F O O D D I E T | 8 I Raw plant foods fall into fourteen major categories: 1.  Fruits: Fruits are raw plant foods that contain the seed within themselves for the reproduction of their kind.  Fruits may be sweet, non-sweet or fat-dominant.  2."
