    "fullText": "T H E S U N F O O D D I E T Ioi phorus (acid) in the tissues.  The high calcium content of the lettuce and broc- coli immediately loosens constricted tissues.  The high potassium content of this drink provides a mineral balance against sodium.  The apple is provided to sweeten.  Or...  Salad: 1 head of lettuce 1 large collard leaf 1/4 head of green cabbage 1 ounce (30 ml) of organic stone-crushed, cold-pressed extra virgin olive oil 1-2 avocados 10 strawberries Mix together and toss into a salad.  Eat this salad twice each day: once for lunch, once for dinner.  The high-calcium content of green-leafed vegetables loosens constricted tissues.  Most back pain is associated with an acid condi- tion of the body - calcium counteracts and neutralizes acidity.  The strawberries are included because they contain organic salycilates, which are the basic ingredient of painkillers, such as aspirin."
