    "excerpt": "The enslavement, torture and death of animals for food, leather, wool, cosmetics, toiletries, down, medicine, etc.  is leading humanity's fate to an ever-more perilous position.  The mass destruction and exploitation of animal life is causing chaos in the spiritual world.  Every animal exploited leaves a karmic ripple ...",
    "fullText": "K A R M A The enslavement, torture and death of animals for food, leather, wool, cosmetics, toiletries, down, medicine, etc.  is leading humanity's fate to an ever-more perilous position.  The mass destruction and exploitation of animal life is causing chaos in the spiritual world.  Every animal exploited leaves a karmic ripple in the fabric of time that must eventually return back."
