    "excerpt": "Don't worry about them, embrace them as part of the detoxi- fication process.  Other detoxification symptoms may include: bad breath, coughs, cold symptoms, drowsiness, headaches, momentary aches, nausea, unclear thinking and/or weight loss.  While detoxifying, the body makes use of all its eliminative organs: the bowe...",
    "fullText": "Detoxification Don't worry about them, embrace them as part of the detoxi- fication process.  Other detoxification symptoms may include: bad breath, coughs, cold symptoms, drowsiness, headaches, momentary aches, nausea, unclear thinking and/or weight loss.  While detoxifying, the body makes use of all its eliminative organs: the bowels, lungs, mouth, sinuses, skin and kidneys, thus releases will occur in those areas.  The urine, in general, is an excellent reflection of the blood; urine is puri- fied blood.  Turbidity in the urine is indicative of toxicity being released from the blood.  Clear urine is a sign that the blood is clean at that moment."
