    "excerpt": "If one is more purified on a vegetarian or vegan diet and eating organic food, the detoxification may be more mild.  Just as it takes years for your tissues to become encumbered by improper materials, so too does it take years to dissolve and eliminate these improper materials.  In general, I have found that it takes o...",
    "fullText": "Detoxification If one is more purified on a vegetarian or vegan diet and eating organic food, the detoxification may be more mild.  Just as it takes years for your tissues to become encumbered by improper materials, so too does it take years to dissolve and eliminate these improper materials.  In general, I have found that it takes one month on a 100% Sunfood Diet to reverse one year on a cooked, toxic diet."
