    "excerpt": "As you lighten the body of obstructions, a joy shall usher forth, such as you have never experienced in your life.  You will laugh for no reason.  When one radiates health and vitality, one no longer draws on the vitality of other humans, animals and plants.  This is due to one's increased energy which diffuses from ar...",
    "fullText": "Detoxification As you lighten the body of obstructions, a joy shall usher forth, such as you have never experienced in your life.  You will laugh for no reason.  When one radiates health and vitality, one no longer draws on the vitality of other humans, animals and plants.  This is due to one's increased energy which diffuses from areas of greater concentration to areas of lesser concentration.  As energy diffuses, it also creates a magnetism which manifests itself, in the form of charisma.  A clean body is charismatic."
