    "excerpt": "Some prominent superfoods include: - Marine phytoplankton (this outstanding superfood forms the basis of the entire food chain for the whole planet.  Marine phytoplankton is a source of DHA, EPA, and phospholipids) - Spirulina (a spiral algae consumed for thousands of years by indigenous people in Mexico and Africa.  T...",
    "fullText": "T H E Secret Revealed Some prominent superfoods include: - Marine phytoplankton (this outstanding superfood forms the basis of the entire food chain for the whole planet.  Marine phytoplankton is a source of DHA, EPA, and phospholipids) - Spirulina (a spiral algae consumed for thousands of years by indigenous people in Mexico and Africa.  The highest concentration of protein on Earth) - Blue-Green Algae (Klamath lake algae has a phenomenal reputation in the health field) - Chlorella (another high-protein algae that has the special property of detox- ifying heavy metals from the brain when used in conjunction with cilantro) - Bee pollen (wild pollen, not orchard pollen, should be used and should come from ethically harvested sources where bees are treated respectfully.  Bee pollen is nature's most complete food) - Maca (a radish-family root that grows in the high Andes.  This root increases the production of progesterone in women and testosterone in men."
