    "fullText": "T H E Secret Revealed | 203 taste incredible.  They contain at least 18 amino acids, are a complete protein and a fantastic source of minerals) - Hemp seed (the only seed with no enzyme inhibitors.  Contains edestin perhaps the most bio-available form of protein.  Also contains the youthening sulfur-bearing amino acids and a unique array of minerals) - Wild young coconuts (not to be confused with white Thai coconuts found in markets, wild coconuts are one of the greatest foods on Earth.  The coconut water and soft inner flesh are strength enhancing, electrolyte-rich, mineral-rich, youthening and invigorating.  Wild young coconut water is the best base for any smoothie - especially great with other superfoods) Remember, as with all foods, not all superfoods work for everybody, find the ones that agree with you and enjoy.  I usually use them in morning smoothie drinks.  Real strength and building material comes from green-leafed vegetables, seeds and superfoods where the amino acids are found."
