    "fullText": "42% Fats I recommend you do so in the method shown in the previous diagram.  The secret to gaining strength and weight by eating a raw plant-food diet is to eat green-leafed vegetables and plant fats together - and fewer sweet fruits - as well as by adding superfoods (spirulina, raw hemp protein, maca, etc. ) into one's diet.  More non-sweet fruits may be included as well.  Consuming these foods in a blended state is recommended.  My own experience proved this true.  I found it worked for thousands of others.  Test for yourself and see.  Think of the gorilla: pound per pound the strongest land mammal.  The gorilla possesses a fantastic musculature and is capable of bench pressing 4,000 pounds (more than 1800 kg).  In his wonderful book, L'Homme, Le Singe, Et Le Paradis (Humans, Primates, and Paradise), Albert Mosseri describes: (Translation) \"The gorilla is not interested in eating so-called protein foods."
