    "excerpt": "Supplements that can be helpful with Candida include: olive leaf extract, grapefruit seed extract, supplemental enzymes (Beauty Enzymes), MSM (methyl-sulfonyl-methane) powder, small amounts of fully-mineralized sea salt or rock salt, edible clays and powdered vitamin C-rich berries such as camu camu berry powder.  MSM ...",
    "fullText": "U S E T H E Supplements that can be helpful with Candida include: olive leaf extract, grapefruit seed extract, supplemental enzymes (Beauty Enzymes), MSM (methyl-sulfonyl-methane) powder, small amounts of fully-mineralized sea salt or rock salt, edible clays and powdered vitamin C-rich berries such as camu camu berry powder.  MSM detoxifies mercury.  Mercury poisoning seems to be a common underlying factor in Candida.  H o w TO USE T H E S U N F O O U TRIANGLE Candida (and while moving into raw foods in general) one should seek out coun- selors, friends, books, DVD's and/or audiotapes that can assist with emotional releases."
