    "excerpt": "Identify the hybridized foods (raw or cooked) in your diet. Decide to replace these foods with more natural foods as soon, and as often, as possible. Particularly watch out for foods high in sugar and low in minerals. 2 The solution to hybridized food? Grow your own food from heirloom seeds (contact heirloom seed banks...",
    "fullText": "H Y B R I D F O O D Identify the hybridized foods (raw or cooked) in your diet. Decide to replace these foods with more natural foods as soon, and as often, as possible. Particularly watch out for foods high in sugar and low in minerals. 2 The solution to hybridized food? Grow your own food from heirloom seeds (contact heirloom seed banks through the internet). Also, whenever possible, eat wild plants and fruits. Participate in a hands-on class - in the field - with a local herbalist."
