    "excerpt": "Having said all that, the coup de grace of tooth health and healing comes back to the simple logic of observing nature.  Which animals possess the strongest teeth?  The ruminants.  The cow, horse, zebra, goat, wildebeest, etc.  These animals are primarily grass eaters.  I have made light of this observation and in my e...",
    "fullText": "T E E T H Having said all that, the coup de grace of tooth health and healing comes back to the simple logic of observing nature.  Which animals possess the strongest teeth?  The ruminants.  The cow, horse, zebra, goat, wildebeest, etc.  These animals are primarily grass eaters.  I have made light of this observation and in my experience, nothing works better for strengthening teeth than chewing wild grasses."
