    "fullText": "S U N Without this vitamin the bones do not become calcified and will bend easily.  This condition is called rickets. \" Dr.  Kime describes that Sunlight builds the immune system and increases the oxygenation of the skin.  Dr.  Kime writes: MA study of the results of combined Sunlight and exercise, showed that group that was getting the Sunlight treatments with exercise, had improved almost twice as much as shown by their electrocardiograms, as had those who only exercised, even though both groups were on a general health resort treatment program. \" Sunlight lowers blood sugar.  It is a natural insulin.  A diet high in sweet fruit must also be accompanied by Sunshine on the skin to help metabolize the sugar."
