    "excerpt": "One mind can broadcast, and the thunder of that communication echoes through the cosmos, whereby it is picked up by those tuned to the same frequency and they share in the vibrations of that thought.  Synchronous living — An antenna in your mind.  T A P P I N G I N F I N I T E I N T E L L I G E N C E Broadcast to the w...",
    "fullText": "T A P P I N G I N F I N I T E One mind can broadcast, and the thunder of that communication echoes through the cosmos, whereby it is picked up by those tuned to the same frequency and they share in the vibrations of that thought.  Synchronous living — An antenna in your mind.  T A P P I N G I N F I N I T E I N T E L L I G E N C E Broadcast to the world And everything you'll find.  The flow of infinite intelligence is accelerated by what Napoleon Hill originally called \"The Mastermind Principle. \" He defined it as \"an alliance of two or more minds blended in a spirit of perfect harmony and co-operating for the attainment of a definite purpose. \" This principle is invoked when another mind, operating at the same frequency as the first - with identical hopes, aims and purposes as the first - is brought into communication with the first.  When this synchronicity occurs, a third intangible cooperative mind is formed within the sphere of infi- nite intelligence."
