    "excerpt": "1 After eating plenty of raw foods for at least 6 months, prepare and under- take your first fast. While fasting, read books on fasting. This will help strengthen your resolve. I recommend Rational Fasting by Professor Arnold Ehret, Fasting Can Save Your Life by Dr. Herbert Shelton and The Miracle Of Fasting by Paul Br...",
    "fullText": "Time M A N A G E M E N T T H R O U G H Fasting 1 After eating plenty of raw foods for at least 6 months, prepare and under- take your first fast. While fasting, read books on fasting. This will help strengthen your resolve. I recommend Rational Fasting by Professor Arnold Ehret, Fasting Can Save Your Life by Dr. Herbert Shelton and The Miracle Of Fasting by Paul Bragg. 2 As a healthy life discipline, make routine fasting part of your life. Fast three to seven days on water, fruit juice and or vegetable juice during the change of seasons. Fast when you attend seminars. Fast for time management. Fast for fun!"
