    "fullText": "T H E Far Side Of Failure On the far side of failure, Beyond the path of rejection Far past the ghosts Of d o u b t and dejection. Just a bit farther Than life's toughest question. Over the stream r u n n i n g , After each lost election. Farther along Than the extra mile. Floating further Than the lonely isle. P E R S I S T E N C E | 4 5 7 Beyond the sign: \"The buck stops here.\" Over pools reflecting — The faces of fear. Over chasms deep Where things seem worst, Through hardened deserts, Overcome by thirst. Even surpassing The road traveled less Lies the hidden valley Of massive success."
