    "fullText": "Thanks Giving Great spirit. Thank you For the all the beings Who contributed to this meal And for the vitality of this food. We relish our bounty And revere your creation. Chewing Be sure to fully chew every mouthful of food. The famous Dr. Fletcher recom- mended 50 chews per mouthful. Try eating with chopsticks instead of kitchen utensils as they will help to slow the rate of your eating. Sea Vegetables With raw nutrition, sea vegetables have a balancing effect because they contain a dense amount of trace minerals and alkaline-mineral salts. Sea vegetables, however, grow in the sea, and are subject to intake the pollution found there. Reputable sources for these products are important. www.sunfood.com distributes many varieties of sea vegetables (dulse,"
