    "excerpt": "The Basic Sunfood Diet At this level, the focus is to include significantly more raw plant foods and their juices into the diet. At this level, one should make the commitment to seek out organic foods. This diet is about abundance, not denial. Therefore, on Day 5: Friday and Day 6: Saturday one may still eat their favo...",
    "fullText": "T H E B A S I C S U N F O O D Diet W E E K L Y M E N U The Basic Sunfood Diet At this level, the focus is to include significantly more raw plant foods and their juices into the diet. At this level, one should make the commitment to seek out organic foods. This diet is about abundance, not denial. Therefore, on Day 5: Friday and Day 6: Saturday one may still eat their favorite meals in the evening but with a salad. Over time, as one eats more raw foods containing the three food classes along with a wide variety of superfoods and other raw plant foods, and less cooked foods, the taste buds will change and a dietary shift will happen automatically. ì"
