    "fullText": "A P P E N D I X C 10 kale leaves 1 lemon Juice.  I recommend this drink to all athletes.  Alkalinity, juvenile water, sodium and calcium... everything is there.  Captain's Powerhouse Two handfuls of greens (preferably wild) 2 spoon meat coconuts with water 2 avocados Blend.  We used to drink this in my office daily.  Cherimoya Cream 1 avocado 2 cherimoyas Remove pit, seeds and skins from the avocado and the cherimoyas.  Put the fruits in a blender.  Blend.  This is a splendid combination which one must taste to believe.  Estrogen Booster 2 yams Juice.  This drink is for young women looking for a boost, menopausal women, or anyone looking to taste something great.  Feijoa & OJ.  10 feijoas (pineapple guavas) 10 oranges Cut all fruits in half.  Juice on a citrus juicer.  The smooth feijoa balances the acids in the oranges.  This is my favorite sweet winter juice.  Iron Boost 10 strawberries 10 raspberries 1 slice of watermelon 1 handful of parsley Mix, blend and serve!"
