    "excerpt": "A warm, loft-like space frequented by a compelling cross-section of the city's yoga, arts and conscious busi- ness communities. Organic is nestled in the up-and-coming Raval neigh- bourhood, just a few minutes walk along C. de I'Hospital from the Rambla. While serving mostly Indian- influenced and traditional Spanish c...",
    "fullText": "S P A I N A warm, loft-like space frequented by a compelling cross-section of the city's yoga, arts and conscious busi- ness communities. Organic is nestled in the up-and-coming Raval neigh- bourhood, just a few minutes walk along C. de I'Hospital from the Rambla. While serving mostly Indian- influenced and traditional Spanish cooked vegetarian fare, they also offer a bountiful salad bar, with superior olive oil and condiments. Whole avocados are available upon request. Full-moon, raw evenings are tradi- tional here."
