    "excerpt": "We have come together through a love of trees, nature and a desire to foster harmony between the human race and mother earth, her plants and creatures, thus restoring this planet through each of our actions.  It has been estimated that the planting of 18 billion trees (that is three planted by each person on this globe...",
    "fullText": "Happier, More Abundant, Forested Future On Earth. Please Read Our Mission Statement And Decide That You Want To Donate To This Worthy Cause.\" — We have come together through a love of trees, nature and a desire to foster harmony between the human race and mother earth, her plants and creatures, thus restoring this planet through each of our actions.  It has been estimated that the planting of 18 billion trees (that is three planted by each person on this globe) would reverse the atmospheric pollution damage.  We choose trees that yield edible fruit nutritious leaves or roots or are fruit- fully useful in some other manner."
