    "excerpt": "David Wolfe has degrees in Mechanical and Environmental Engineering, Political Science, a Juris Doctor in Law, and a masters in Living-Food Nutrition.  He has studied at many institutions including Oxford University.  David Wolfe is the middle son of two medical doctors, which provides him with a unique perspective in ...",
    "fullText": "David \"Avocado\" Wolfe David Wolfe has degrees in Mechanical and Environmental Engineering, Political Science, a Juris Doctor in Law, and a masters in Living-Food Nutrition.  He has studied at many institutions including Oxford University.  David Wolfe is the middle son of two medical doctors, which provides him with a unique perspective in the health field.  Since 1995, David Wolfe has given over 1,000 health lectures and seminars in the United States, Canada, Europe, the South Pacific and Central America.  He hosts at least five health, fitness and adventure retreats each year at various retreat centers around the world.  You may view his current schedule at: www. sunfood. com/events. html David is the founder of the non-profit Fruit Tree Planting Foundation (www. ftpf. org) whose goal is to plant 18 billion fruit trees on planet Earth.  David is also the founder of, and leading contributor to, the internet's only Peak Performance and Nutrition online magazine: www. thebestdayever. com."
