    "fullText": "David \"Avocado\" Wolfe | A B O U T T H E A U T H O R As part of his action-packed schedule, David also coaches and feeds Hollywood producers and celebrities as well as some of the world's leading business people.  David is currently completing several new books, and occa- sionally plays drums for the raw rock and roll group - The Healing Waters Band (www. thehealingwatersband. com).  In 2004, David starred as \"Avocado\" in the reality television show Mad Mad House airing on the Science Fiction Channel.  Other than a passion for raw-food nutrition and music, David's favorite hobbies include: hiking, yoga, literature, writing, alchemy, chemistry, nature adventures, hot springing, planting fruit trees, spending time with loved ones and having The Best Day Ever!  To contact David or book him on a television or radio show, for an interview or for a seminar please contact: www. sunfood."
