    "fullText": "1. Abuta (*Cissampelos pareira*) - **Posologie & Modes d'Administration** :  - **Dosage Standard** : stops bleeding kills bacteria Vine Wood balances menstruation enhances memory Decoction: 1 cup 2-3 times daily relieves pain prevents convulsions Tincture: 2-3 ml 2-3 times daily reduces cramps fights free radicals Capsules: 1-2 g 2-3 times daily relaxes muscles prevents ulcers stops inflammation reduces mucous increases urination reduces fever protects cells protects liver lowers blood pressure balances hormones inhibits tumors kills viruses  - **Infusion / Décoction** : 1 cuillère à café à soupe de plante séchée par tasse d'eau chaude, infuser 10-15 min.   - **Teinture** : 2 à 4 ml (environ 30 à 60 gouttes) 2 fois par jour.  - **Contre-indications & Précautions** :  - 1.  Abuta has been documented to lower blood pressure in two animal studies; therefore, abuta is probably contraindicated for people with low blood pressure."
