    "fullText": "8. Amargo (*Quassia amara*) - **Posologie & Modes d'Administration** :  - **Dosage Standard** : kills parasites reduces inflammation Wood, Bark kills lice & insects kills cancer cells Infusion: 1 cup 2-3 times daily expels worms kills leukemia cells Capsules: 1-2 g 2-3 times daily lowers cholesterol prevents tumors Maceration: 1 cup 2-3 times daily treats malaria dries secretions prevents ulcers cleanses blood kills viruses mildly laxative stimulates digestion sedates increases bile increases saliva balances blood sugar kills bacteria  - **Infusion / Décoction** : 1 cuillère à café à soupe de plante séchée par tasse d'eau chaude, infuser 10-15 min.   - **Teinture** : 2 à 4 ml (environ 30 à 60 gouttes) 2 fois par jour.  - **Contre-indications & Précautions** :  - Amargo should not be used during pregnancy.  Amargo has been documented in several studies to have antifertility effects in both female and male rats."
