    "fullText": "10. Anamu (*Petiveria alliacea*) - **Posologie & Modes d'Administration** :  - **Dosage Standard** : reduces pain reduces spasms Whole plant kills bacteria reduces anxiety Infusion: 1/4 to 1/2 cup 2-3 kills cancer cells reduces depression times daily kills fungi lowers blood sugar Capsules: 1-3 g daily reduces inflammation kills insects kills leukemia cells promotes menstruation reduces free radicals sedates prevents tumors increases perspiration kills viruses expels worms kills Candida increases urination enhances immunity educes fever modulates immune function protects brain  - **Infusion / Décoction** : 1 cuillère à café à soupe de plante séchée par tasse d'eau chaude, infuser 10-15 min.   - **Teinture** : 2 à 4 ml (environ 30 à 60 gouttes) 2 fois par jour.  - **Contre-indications & Précautions** :  - Anamu has been documented to lower blood pressure in two animal studies; therefore, anamu is probably contraindicated for people with low blood pressure."
