    "excerpt": "An alkaloid in anamu, tetrandrine, has been documented to have various actions on heart function in animals and humans.  Those with a heart condition or taking heart medications should consult with their doctor before using this plant.  Anamu has demonstrated to be a uterine relaxant and traditionally employed as a chi...",
    "fullText": "10. Anamu (*Petiveria alliacea*) An alkaloid in anamu, tetrandrine, has been documented to have various actions on heart function in animals and humans.  Those with a heart condition or taking heart medications should consult with their doctor before using this plant.  Anamu has demonstrated to be a uterine relaxant and traditionally employed as a childbirth aid.  A pregnant woman should use it only under the supervision of a qualified healthcare practitioner.  - **Note Vitaliste** : Fiche botanique officielle Rain-Tree issue des recherches du Dr.  Leslie Taylor sur la pharmacopée amazonienne."
