    "fullText": "39. Cipo Cabeludo (*Mikania hirsutissima*) - **Posologie & Modes d'Administration** :  - **Dosage Standard** : relieves pain kills leukemia cells Vine, Leaves reduces inflammation kills cancer cells Infusion: 1/2 cup twice daily increases urination calms nerves Tincture: 5-10 ml twice daily thins blood reduces mucus fights free radicals protects cells & organs kills bacteria improves kidney function improves prostate function  - **Infusion / Décoction** : 1 cuillère à café à soupe de plante séchée par tasse d'eau chaude, infuser 10-15 min.   - **Teinture** : 2 à 4 ml (environ 30 à 60 gouttes) 2 fois par jour.  - **Contre-indications & Précautions** :  - 1.  Cipo cabeludo is used in herbal medicine as a diuretic.  While these effects have not been confirmed scientifically, use of this plant may be contraindicated in various medical conditions where diuretics are not appropriate."
