    "fullText": "74. Jabuticaba (*Plinia cauliflora*) - **Posologie & Modes d'Administration** :  - **Dosage Standard** : ‎fights free radicals lowers uric acid Fruit relieves oxidative stress prevents mutations Fresh Juice: 1 cup 2-3 times daily reduces inflammation balances cholesterol Capsules: 2-4 g twice daily or protects organs lowers blood sugar follow label directions on promotes weight loss lowers blood pressure kills bacteria kills cancer cells slows aging kills fungi reduces stress & anxiety prevents chronic diseases  - **Infusion / Décoction** : 1 cuillère à café à soupe de plante séchée par tasse d'eau chaude, infuser 10-15 min.   - **Teinture** : 2 à 4 ml (environ 30 à 60 gouttes) 2 fois par jour.  - **Contre-indications & Précautions** :  - Jabuticaba may lower blood pressure and blood sugar levels.  These effects were recorded in both humans and animals with effects recorded as milder in humans than in animals."
