    "fullText": "86. Maqui Berry (*Aristotelia chilensis*) - **Posologie & Modes d'Administration** :  - **Dosage Standard** : ‎fights free radicals kills cancer cells Fruit relieves oxidative stress prevents cancer Fresh Juice: 1 cup 2-3 times daily reduces inflammation balances cholesterol Capsules: 2-4 g twice daily or protects organs lowers blood sugar follow label directions on promotes weight loss lowers blood pressure kills bacteria kills cancer cells slows aging relieves depression prevents chronic diseases modulates immune system  - **Infusion / Décoction** : 1 cuillère à café à soupe de plante séchée par tasse d'eau chaude, infuser 10-15 min.   - **Teinture** : 2 à 4 ml (environ 30 à 60 gouttes) 2 fois par jour.  - **Contre-indications & Précautions** :  - Maqui berries may lower blood pressure and blood sugar levels.  These effects were recorded in both humans and animals with effects recorded as milder in humans than in animals."
