    "fullText": "89. Mullaca (*Physalis angulata*) - **Posologie & Modes d'Administration** :  - **Dosage Standard** : kills bacteria relieves pain Infusion: 1/2 to 1 cup 1-3 kills cancer cells reduces spasms times daily kills leukemia cells lowers blood sugar Capsules: 1-2 g twice daily fights free radicals prevents ulcers Tincture: 1-3 ml twice daily relieves inflammation increases urination kills viruses reduces fever modulates immune system protects cells & organs relieves oxidative stress kills parasites reduces fibrosis prevents diabetic complications lowers blood pressure  - **Infusion / Décoction** : 1 cuillère à café à soupe de plante séchée par tasse d'eau chaude, infuser 10-15 min.   - **Teinture** : 2 à 4 ml (environ 30 à 60 gouttes) 2 fois par jour.  - **Contre-indications & Précautions** :  - Several animal studies indicates this plant may lower blood pressure and one test tube study demonstrated a blood anticoagulant activity."
