    "fullText": "103. Quebra Pedra (*Phyllanthus niruri*) - **Posologie & Modes d'Administration** :  - **Dosage Standard** : expels stones kills bacteria Whole herb supports kidneys treats malaria Infusion: 1 cup 2-3 times daily kills viruses prevents mutations Fluid Extract: 2-4 ml 2-3 relieves pain reduces fever times daily protects liver mildly laxative Capsules: 1-2 g twice daily relieves oxidative stress promotes healthy aging fights free radicals protects cells & organs reduces inflammation increases urination kills and prevents cancer reduces spasms reduces blood sugar detoxifies liver lowers blood pressure lowers cholesterol  - **Infusion / Décoction** : 1 cuillère à café à soupe de plante séchée par tasse d'eau chaude, infuser 10-15 min.   - **Teinture** : 2 à 4 ml (environ 30 à 60 gouttes) 2 fois par jour.  - **Contre-indications & Précautions** :  - 1, Chanca piedra has demonstrated hypotensive effects in animals and humans."
