    "fullText": "124. YERBA MATE (Ilex paraguariensis) Database file in the Tropical Plant Database (*Ilex paraguayiensis*) - **Posologie & Modes d'Administration** :  - **Dosage Standard** : increases energy relieves pain Leaves promotes weight loss increases bile Infusion: 1 cup 2-3 suppresses appetite mildly laxative times daily burns fat protects liver Capsules: 1-2 g twice daily reduces inflammation reduces blood pressure modulates immune system enhances immunity prevents chronic diseases protects brain protects heart relieves depression fights free radicals reduces blood sugar avoids diabetic complications protects bones relieves oxidative stress enhances memory  - **Infusion / Décoction** : 1 cuillère à café à soupe de plante séchée par tasse d'eau chaude, infuser 10-15 min.   - **Teinture** : 2 à 4 ml (environ 30 à 60 gouttes) 2 fois par jour.  - **Contre-indications & Précautions** :  - Yerba mate contains caffeine and should not be used by those who are sensitive or allergic to caffeine."
